@startuml "05-state-machine"
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #080F1D
skinparam defaultFontColor #E2E8F0
skinparam arrowColor #42C8FF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #111C2E
skinparam stateBorderColor #42C8FF
skinparam stateFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateStartColor #22C55E
skinparam stateEndColor #EF4444

[*] --> INITIALIZING : Boot / Power-On

state INITIALIZING {
  INITIALIZING : entry / Load spacecraft physical constants
  INITIALIZING : do / Verify memory checksum & sensor sanity
  INITIALIZING : exit / Register in Active Constellation Fleet
}

state NOMINAL {
  NOMINAL : entry / Enable nominal payload operations
  NOMINAL : do / Continuous telemetry broadcasting (1 Hz)
  NOMINAL : do / Closed-loop nadir / sun-pointing ADCS
}

state DEGRADED {
  DEGRADED : entry / Restrict high-draw payload duties
  DEGRADED : do / Monitor failing subsystem parameters
  DEGRADED : do / Await operator investigation or triage
}

state SAFE_MODE {
  SAFE_MODE : entry / Cut off all non-essential loads (Payload=0W)
  SAFE_MODE : entry / Orient solar arrays to coarse sun-pointing
  SAFE_MODE : do / Transmit low-rate telemetry beacon (0.2 Hz)
  SAFE_MODE : do / Maintain survival heaters active
}

state EMERGENCY {
  EMERGENCY : entry / Issue autonomous acoustic/visual alarm to ground
  EMERGENCY : do / Critical power brownout or thermal runaway containment
  EMERGENCY : do / Reject standard commands without emergency override
}

state RECOVERY {
  RECOVERY : entry / Execute validated telecommand sequence
  RECOVERY : do / Evaluate post-recovery sensor telemetry
  RECOVERY : do / Gradual subsystem power-on ramp
}

state OFFLINE {
  OFFLINE : entry / Loss of communication or catastrophic deorbit
  OFFLINE : do / Read-only telemetry archive retention
}

' Transitions & Guards
INITIALIZING --> NOMINAL : [Self-test passed && Bus voltage >= 26.0V] / Log "BOOT_COMPLETE"
INITIALIZING --> OFFLINE : [Hardware initialization failure] / Alert Ground

NOMINAL --> DEGRADED : [Subsystem threshold warning || Minor sensor SEU] / Trigger "WARNING_ALARM"
DEGRADED --> NOMINAL : [Telemetry recovers within nominal bounds] / Clear Alarm

DEGRADED --> SAFE_MODE : [Battery SOC < 30% || Thermal critical || Loss of attitude] / Shed Loads
NOMINAL --> SAFE_MODE : [Autonomous fault trigger || Ground command CMD_ENTER_SAFE] / Orient Sun

SAFE_MODE --> EMERGENCY : [Battery SOC < 20% || Component Temp > Critical Limit] / Trigger "EMERGENCY_ALARM"
DEGRADED --> EMERGENCY : [Multi-subsystem cascade failure] / Lock Command Gate

EMERGENCY --> RECOVERY : [Emergency ground command validated with override token] / Uplink Recovery Script
SAFE_MODE --> RECOVERY : [Operator issues CMD_INITIATE_RECOVERY during valid pass] / Uplink Sequence

RECOVERY --> NOMINAL : [All telemetry nominal for > 180s && SOC >= 75%] / Re-enable Payloads
RECOVERY --> SAFE_MODE : [Recovery command failed verification || SOC declining] / Re-shed Loads

EMERGENCY --> OFFLINE : [Complete power exhaustion (SOC=0%) || Thermal burnout] / Terminate Mission
SAFE_MODE --> OFFLINE : [Permanent orbital decay / Loss of signal > 72h] / Mark Inactive

' Rejection Note
note right of SAFE_MODE
  **Illegal Transitions Blocked:**
  Direct transition from SAFE_MODE or EMERGENCY
  to NOMINAL without passing through RECOVERY
  is strictly rejected by the digital twin engine.
end note

note bottom of NOMINAL
  **Operational Invariant:**
  Satellite Operational Mode is distinct from
  Incident Severity (INFO/WARN/CRIT) and
  Command Pipeline Status (QUEUED/VALIDATING/etc).
end note

@enduml
